  "scope": "Post-hoc descriptive audit prompted by very large7B ARC-Challenge individual relative errors. Reproduces the actual saved factor-error definition on held-out vectors, including the raw-factor squared-norm denominator floor1e-12. Smallest half is ranked by token-normalized concatenated true-gradient norm. Matrix Frobenius error weights examples by squared gradient magnitude and is distinct from error of the summed batch gradient. All outputs remain finite. No predictor, objective, checkpoint, selection, or hypothesis is changed; no alternative objective is tested."
